      "html": "<section class=\"wd-section\"><div class=\"wd-container\"><div class=\"wd-section-head\"><div><span class=\"wd-eyebrow\">What we do</span><h2>Design that does the work</h2></div><p class=\"wd-lead\">Services adapted to your goals, not a fixed template.</p></div><div class=\"wd-grid\"><article class=\"wd-card\"><span class=\"wd-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><h3>Experience design</h3><p>Flows, navigation and interface systems.</p></article><article class=\"wd-card\"><span class=\"wd-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◇</span><h3>Development</h3><p>Responsive and maintainable websites.</p></article><article class=\"wd-card\"><span class=\"wd-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◎</span><h3>Optimization</h3><p>Accessibility and performance audits.</p></article></div></div></section>",
