      "html": "<section class=\"wd-section\"><div class=\"wd-container\"><div class=\"wd-section-head\"><div><span class=\"wd-eyebrow\">Questions</span><h2>Good things to know</h2></div></div><details class=\"wd-disclosure\"><summary>Can I change the colors?</summary><p>Yes. Semantic CSS variables let you switch between themes without rebuilding the layout.</p></details><details class=\"wd-disclosure\"><summary>Does it require JavaScript?</summary><p>No. Native details elements and ordinary links work without a framework.</p></details></div></section>",
